name: Full and pipeline enter shared Setup with finite unapproved Map and Scan drafts
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: full
require-live-snap: 25 READY THE MAP RUN | full-setup
expect: Start Map
expect-not: MAP · ROUTE
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Build threat model | map-choices
keys: Down Down Space Enter
require-live-snap: 20 READY THE MAP RUN | selected-model-map
expect: APPROVAL NEXT
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | bounded-map
expect: 3 fixed jobs
keys: t
type: 5
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | map-approval
expect: Context: 3 fixed jobs
resize: 160x48
live-snap: map-approval-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: map-approval-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: map-approval-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: map-approval-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: map-approval-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | map-final-terms-40x12
ask: Does full show shared Setup and a finite Map draft, with workload and spending readable at every size before approval?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | cancelled-map-approval
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 READY THE MAP RUN | returned-setup
expect: APPROVAL NEXT
type: plan scan
require-live-snap: 10 plan scan | setup-command-draft
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | finite-scan
expect: Discovery passes
expect: Workers
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | engine-choice
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 [x] agentic | selected-engine
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Engine choices updated | applied-engine
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Omit threat-model context | context-choice
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | explicit-omission
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-scan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART both
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 READY THE MAP RUN | setup-after-scan
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | preserved-map-selection
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: pipeline
require-live-snap: 25 READY THE MAP RUN | pipeline-restart
expect: Start Map
expect-not: MAP · ROUTE
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART both
ask: Does cancellation return to Setup with the Map selection and both unapproved drafts retained, and does pipeline restart without work or a legacy wizard?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | restart-plan-choice-exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
